warning[unused_result]: the result of `trim` is discarded; it does not change its arguments
  --> tests/lint/unused_result/bad.jai:7:5
   |
 7 |     trim(line);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to update the argument, write `line = trim(line);`
   = note: `unused_result` is `warn` by default

warning[unused_result]: the result of `min` is discarded; it does not change its arguments
  --> tests/lint/unused_result/bad.jai:9:5
   |
 9 |     min(a, 4);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: to update the argument, write `a = min(a, 4);`
   = note: `unused_result` is `warn` by default

warning[unused_result]: the result of `sqrt` is discarded; it does not change its arguments
  --> tests/lint/unused_result/bad.jai:10:5
